(((HDD*Energy_use_per_HDD+CDD*energy_use_per_CDD)*UNIT_GJ_to_MWh)*Population*Converter_2)-total_change_in_energy_used_for_heating_and_cooling_due_to_climate_change
ELSE
(((HDD*Energy_use_per_HDD+CDD*energy_use_per_CDD)*UNIT_GJ_to_MWh)*Population*Converter_2)</eqn>
