				<text_box uid="18" x="291.874" y="2122.68" width="260" height="58">This is a PID controler
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Proportional%E2%80%93integral%E2%80%93derivative_controller</text_box>
				<text_box uid="19" x="291.874" y="2080.48" width="260" height="29.6667">PID factors. Negative values dampen deviations, positive values amplify</text_box>
				<text_box uid="20" x="128.981" y="2010.93" width="131.667" height="15">Proportional control</text_box>
				<text_box uid="21" x="320.952" y="2017.86" width="145.928" height="16.875">differentiating control, smoothes </text_box>
				<text_box uid="22" x="591.161" y="2017.8" width="145.928" height="58.6666">integrating control, responds to continuing deviations</text_box>
